<title>RUSSIA: Russia Jan-July aluminium exports at 1.526 mln T.</title>
<headline>Russia Jan-July aluminium exports at 1.526 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia exported 1.526 million tonnes of aluminium to all destinations over January-July, State Statistics Committee figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The committee released the following data:</p>
<p>				 METALS EXPORTS</p>
<p>		Jan-July   pct change    July 1996 pct change</p>
<p>	    (in tonnes)    yr/yr	    mth/mth	yr/yr</p>
<p>Aluminium  1,526,000	+30		  +1	   +23</p>
<p>Copper	 303,000	+31		  +99	  +28</p>
<p>Nickel	  90,700	+13		 +193	  +64</p>
<p>(Some of Russia's metals exports in July traditionally soar on June levels as northern waterways and export outlets unfreeze).</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
